{"about_the_game":"Solar Wave is a large-scale space strategy with indirect control. The 21st millennium, the Solar Empire conquers the entire Milky Way and rushes to the nearest galaxy. It turns out that these worlds are already inhabited. But when has this stopped humanity? Become the governor of the empire and ensure the success of the invasion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/c8595d00267d14a05bd5d874f3ec2b51.poster.avif?t=1760954800\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/c8595d00267d14a05bd5d874f3ec2b51.webm?t=1760954800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/c8595d00267d14a05bd5d874f3ec2b51.mp4?t=1760954800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4x space strategy - explore the stars, colonize new worlds, capture territories.<br></li><li>Indirect control of fleets - is not the business of the governor to give orders to every soldier of the empire. Each fleet has its own tasks, and they diligently try to fulfill it.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/4d5c84c078d83f70d40d3ae339d95b88.poster.avif?t=1760954800\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/4d5c84c078d83f70d40d3ae339d95b88.webm?t=1760954800\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3212820/extras/4d5c84c078d83f70d40d3ae339d95b88.mp4?t=1760954800\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Advanced economic model \u20